OL,3,GNEWSAPlaying festivals but still
OL,4,Arehearsing in a garage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are all in their early 20s and
OL,7,Fpractise in one of their parents'
OL,8,Fgarages, but Greater Manchester band
OL,9,FThe Guest List have spent the year
OL,10,Fplaying gigs in front of thousands of
OL,11,Fpeople.
OL,13,FFrom playing Neighbourhood in
OL,14,FWarrington, to festivals in Japan and
OL,15,Fthen Reading and Leeds over the bank
OL,16,Fholiday weekend, the band have
OL,17,Fperformed on a number of large stages.
OL,19,FAnd they say being from Greater
OL,20,FManchester, has a huge impact on them -
OL,21,Fas does the area's musical heritage.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
